REQUEST_VERSION 1.0.0

ID REQUEST-0018

STATUS APPROVED

DATE 2026-07-27

WHO President Cley Duarte

SCOPE PACE

TITLE

If a project has PACE (in the code or in the chat), the system must be
FORCED to verify PACE on every message -- not rely on the AI choosing to.

RAW_TEXT

Pero necesito que si tiene pace en el codigo o en el chat esto obligue a
verificar en cada mensaje.

PROPOSED_SCOPE PACE

DESIGN_NOTE

Honest feasibility: "forced on every message" requires a hook in the
client's per-message loop -- something PACE cannot inject from a plain
.md. Where it IS possible: agent/CLI clients that support prompt hooks
(e.g. Claude Code UserPromptSubmit hook, Cursor rules) run a command on
every user message. Where it is NOT possible: plain web chats (claude.ai,
ChatGPT web) expose no third-party per-message hook; there the strongest
lever is a mandatory instruction (AGENTS.md / project rules) - convention,
not enforcement. Design: (1) a fast, quiet `pace check` safe on every
message - locates .pace/, caches the PyPI version check so per-message
cost is ~0, prints only what matters; (2) a hook installer that wires
`pace check` into the client per-message hook (Claude Code first). The
enforcing core of F6-30.

PROMOTED_TO

F6-30 first slice: pace check + per-message client hook

APPROVED_BY

President Cley Duarte

END
